Subject: [PATCH 1868/3799] soh: rename func_809CF8F0 -> EnBw_SetupLunge

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: aims at the player, launches the slug forward and upward with the jump sfx and installs the lunging action.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c
index 6f420a8ea..45c26c257 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c
@@ -28,7 +28,8 @@ void EnBw_Walk(EnBw* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_809CEA24 [LLM:HIGH]
 void EnBw_SetupRearUp(EnBw* this);  // was func_809CF72C [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809CF7AC: stretches the slug tall as it rears, then returns it to walking when the stretch runs out.
 void EnBw_RearUp(EnBw* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_809CF7AC [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_809CF8F0(EnBw* this);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809CF8F0: aims at the player, launches the slug forward and upward with the jump sfx and installs the lunging action.
+void EnBw_SetupLunge(EnBw* this);  // was func_809CF8F0 [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_809CF984(EnBw* this, PlayState* play);
